{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17214400","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17214400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1721440001:1":{"text":"머... 멀린 님이세요?","source_cn":"您……您是梅林阁下吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xE00ED94D63C66E3A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"머... 멀린 님이세요?","female":"머... 멀린 님이세요?","variant_male_record_index":"231116","variant_female_record_index":"231117","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721440002:1":{"text":"아니요. 저는 당신을 모시러 온 멀린 님의 조수입니다.","source_cn":"不不不，我是<male>他</male><female...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xF53446E05ADF1C2C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"아니요. 저는 당신을 모시러 온 멀린 님의 조수입니다.","female":"아니요. 저는 당신을 모시러 온 멀린 님의 조수입니다.","variant_male_record_index":"231118","variant_female_record_index":"231119","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721440003:1":{"text":"돈은 가져오셨죠?","source_cn":"钱都带了吗？我看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x375A0EFD2A010054","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721440004:1":{"text":"좋아요. 500골드 확실하군요. 게다가 2골드나 더! 크흠... 그러니까, 왕자님이 분명 에이미 양을 기억하실 겁니다.","source_cn":"很好，500个金币，还多了两个！咳咳……我是说，殿下一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x580D9A9347A86F0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1721440005:1":{"text":"저기... 오리안 왕자님은 어디 계세요? 편지에는 직접 오신다고 하셨는데...","source_cn":"请问……奥利安殿下人在哪里？信上说他会来的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0452D63EF6949325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721440006:1":{"text":"아, 왕자님께서 원래는 직접 오실 계획이었습니다만...","source_cn":"唉，说来不巧。奥利安殿下本来是要亲自来的，但是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A1B10F56876A580","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721440007:1":{"text":"다만?","source_cn":"但是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D46982574A49D78","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721440008:1":{"text":"뱃멀미를 하셔서요. 출발하자마자 심하게 토하시더니 지금은 누워 계시죠.","source_cn":"但殿下他竟然晕船，刚出发就吐得厉害，现在病倒了，还躺着呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9964EFC838EBDFA8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721440009:1":{"text":"심하게요...?! 와, 왕자님은... 괜찮으세요?","source_cn":"病了……？！殿下他……严重吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7FAF3C04BE50F22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721440010:1":{"text":"괜찮으십니다. 약 먹고 쉬시면 나아요.","source_cn":"不严重，吃点药调理调理就好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6AC0A50BA3FFF23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721440011:1":{"text":"하지만 약을 조금 오래 드셔야 해서... 왕자님을 돕고 싶다면 약값을 조금 더 보태주시는 게 어떨까요?","source_cn":"不过嘛，这药得长期吃……你要是真想支持他，就再给点儿药费吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06ECF33D389C05EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721440012:1":{"text":"제가... 가진게 그것 뿐이라서...","source_cn":"可是……我只能凑到这么多……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD094845DFCCFE799","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721440013:1":{"text":"쯧... 이거 곤란하네요.","source_cn":"嗯……这就难办了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x169859C5EF6CF88E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1721440014:1":{"text":"이렇게 하죠. 에이미 양이 진심으로 왕자님을 걱정하시는 것 같으니...","source_cn":"这样吧，我看你是诚心关心奥利安殿下……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x80C7381FF478D023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1721440015:1":{"text":"돈이 부족해도 괜찮습니다. 함께 배에 타시죠. 왕자님을 뵙게 해드리겠습니다.","source_cn":"钱不够也没关系。你直接跟我上船，我带你去见王子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA53D6920A129AEEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1721440016:1":{"text":"정말요?! 정말... 오리안 왕자님을 뵐 수 있는 건가요?","source_cn":"真的吗？！我……我可以见到奥利安殿下？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D58A544DDB19EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1721440017:1":{"text":"물론이죠. 자, 부축해 드리지요.","source_cn":"当然！来，小姐，我扶你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D12C0699EE5BE85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:艾米":{"text":"에이미","source":"艾米","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:穿魔法袍的骗子":{"text":"마법사 로브를 입은 사기꾼","source":"穿魔法袍的骗子","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}